{"data":{"body":"[P2] Complete the pump handle when worker submission fails. A concurrent `drain()` can read this handle and call `join()` before `executor.execute` rejects. Clearing `inFlight` without completing the handle leaves that drainer blocked forever, so the documented inline fallback is never reached. Complete the rejected handle after clearing it, preserving `pending` so the drain loop retries inline, and test this interleaving.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7tZ6F3","finding_digest":"aac518533165517753c2a19a6505499f6fbe5aeb774001bfd423ad028a75fad7","finding_id":"arf_v1_vlcrquzrmvixou6cugngkbkjt5","finding_key":"insight-plugin/exportscheduler.java::schedule::rejected-handle-completion","identity_key":"insight-plugin/exportscheduler.java::schedule::rejected-handle-completion","line":91,"observation_digest":"3b6578526b7aff9902e70c619a701f87391f7ba5404ab70d68274a19dfefe88a","observation_id":"aro_v1_hnsxqutlpl7zsaxhbrqzu4a7q4","path":"insight-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/insight/ExportScheduler.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-10T20:01:06Z","review_id":"arr_v1_saa42mnn4lbejfqoxbjsi46fng","reviewed_base_sha":"8505ec435fef4fae896ea5c3136272258a94ed25","reviewed_head_sha":"bad83f960de5be6acea391b0b2be4f5487e365d8","reviewer":"codex","start_line":86,"suggestion_id":"arsg_v1_c3xexx5uz7fpbq446egibzvk3l"},"pull_request":{"number":703},"record_id":"art_v1_4vryxcuhtcqwz62rz5slrkckfd","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-10T20:01:06Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
